WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:02,020
They all say you are gentle and gentle

2
00:00:02,020 --> 00:00:04,020
Why did you end up here?

3
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:06,270
Just cold-tempered

4
00:00:06,270 --> 00:00:28,050
I have a problem too

5
00:00:28,050 --> 00:00:31,050
You used to hide many things from me and lie to me

6
00:00:31,050 --> 00:00:32,050
That polo match

7
00:00:32,050 --> 00:00:35,140
You obviously went there to plot against the Lu family.

8
00:00:35,140 --> 00:00:37,140
I thought you were seeking death

9
00:00:37,140 --> 00:00:42,540
I was so scared that I almost lost my soul.

10
00:00:42,540 --> 00:00:43,540
Tell me honestly

11
00:00:43,540 --> 00:00:45,540
Is there anything else you are hiding from me?

12
00:00:45,540 --> 00:00:48,180
If you can't tell me

13
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:49,180
Forget it

14
00:00:49,180 --> 00:00:52,820
I had Xu Xiuwen’s legs beaten by someone else
